#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "4. Quantum teleportation {#4-quantum-teleportation}"
msgstr "4. Teleportasi kuantum {#4-quantum-teleportation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us consider the situation when a character Alice wants to send an "
"unknown quantum state $|\\psi \\rangle$ to her friend Bob, who is far away. "
"Assume they can only communicate with classical communication (like using "
"email or a phone). Alice cannot copy the quantum state (due to the no-"
"cloning theorem). If she repeated the same preparation process many times, "
"she could build up statistics as we just did. But what if there is only a "
"single unknown state? This state might have emerged from a physical process "
"you want to study. Or it could be part of a larger quantum computation. In "
"that case, how could Alice send the state to Bob? She can, if she and Bob "
"share a valuable quantum resource: a shared entangled state, like the Bell "
"state introduced in the previous lesson: $\\frac {|00\\rangle + "
"|11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2}.$ You might sometimes also see this referred to as an"
" \"EPR pair\" or an \"e-bit\" (a fundamental unit of entanglement). If Alice"
" shares such an entangled state with Bob, she can *teleport* the unknown "
"quantum state to Bob by performing a series of quantum operations and "
"sending him two bits of classical information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita bayangkan situasi di mana Alice ingin mengirimkan state kuantum "
"yang tidak diketahui $|\\psi \\rangle$ ke temannya Bob yang berada jauh. "
"Asumsikan mereka hanya bisa berkomunikasi secara klasikal (seperti email "
"atau telepon). Alice tidak bisa menyalin state kuantum tersebut (karena "
"teorema no-cloning). Kalau dia mengulangi proses persiapan yang sama "
"berkali-kali, dia bisa mengumpulkan statistik seperti yang baru saja kita "
"lakukan. Tapi bagaimana kalau hanya ada satu state yang tidak diketahui? "
"State ini mungkin muncul dari proses fisik yang ingin kamu pelajari. Atau "
"bisa jadi bagian dari komputasi kuantum yang lebih besar. Dalam kasus itu, "
"bagaimana Alice bisa mengirim state tersebut ke Bob? Dia bisa, jika dia dan "
"Bob berbagi sumber daya kuantum yang berharga: state terkait (entangled) "
"yang sama, seperti Bell state yang diperkenalkan di pelajaran sebelumnya: "
"$\\frac {|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2}.$ Kadang kamu juga melihat ini"
" disebut sebagai \"pasangan EPR\" atau \"e-bit\" (satuan dasar dari "
"keterkaitan/entanglement). Jika Alice berbagi state terkait seperti itu "
"dengan Bob, dia bisa *menteleportasikan* state kuantum yang tidak diketahui "
"ke Bob dengan melakukan serangkaian operasi kuantum dan mengirimkan dua bit "
"informasi klasikal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.1 The protocol of Quantum teleportation {#41-the-protocol-of-quantum-"
"teleportation}"
msgstr ""
"4.1 Protokol teleportasi kuantum {#41-the-protocol-of-quantum-teleportation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Assumption**: Alice has an unknown quantum state $|\\psi \\rangle$ to be "
"sent to Bob. Alice and Bob shares a 2-qubit entangled state, or e-bit, each "
"having one of the qubits physically at their location.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Asumsi**: Alice punya state kuantum yang tidak diketahui $|\\psi \\rangle$"
" yang akan dikirim ke Bob. Alice dan Bob berbagi state terkait 2-Qubit, atau"
" e-bit, masing-masing memegang satu qubit secara fisik di lokasi mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we outline the procedure without explanation. These will be implemented in detail below.\n"
"1. Alice entangles $|\\psi \\rangle$  with her part of the e-bit using the CNOT gate.\n"
"2. Alice applies a Hadamard gate to $|\\psi \\rangle$, and measures both her qubits in the computational basis.\n"
"3. Alice sends Bob her measurement results (either “00”, “01”, “10”, or “11”)\n"
"4. Bob performs a *correction* operator based on Alice’s two-bit of information on his part of the e-bit pair.\n"
"    - If “00”, Bob does nothing\n"
"    - If “01”, Bob applies X gate\n"
"    - If “10”, Bob applies Z gate\n"
"    - If “11”, Bob applies iY = ZX gate\n"
"5. Bob's part of the e-bit becomes $|\\psi \\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut ini garis besar prosedurnya tanpa penjelasan. Ini akan diimplementasikan secara detail di bawah.\n"
"1. Alice meng-entangle $|\\psi \\rangle$ dengan bagiannya dari e-bit menggunakan Gate CNOT.\n"
"2. Alice menerapkan Gate Hadamard ke $|\\psi \\rangle$, dan mengukur kedua qubit-nya dalam basis komputasional.\n"
"3. Alice mengirimkan hasil pengukurannya ke Bob (bisa \"00\", \"01\", \"10\", atau \"11\")\n"
"4. Bob melakukan operator *koreksi* berdasarkan dua bit informasi dari Alice pada bagiannya dari pasangan e-bit.\n"
"    - Kalau \"00\", Bob tidak melakukan apa-apa\n"
"    - Kalau \"01\", Bob menerapkan Gate X\n"
"    - Kalau \"10\", Bob menerapkan Gate Z\n"
"    - Kalau \"11\", Bob menerapkan iY = ZX gate\n"
"5. Bagian Bob dari e-bit menjadi $|\\psi \\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is also worked out in more detail in [Basics of Quantum "
"Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/entanglement-"
"in-action/introduction). But the situation will become more clear as we "
"instantiate this in Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini juga dibahas lebih detail di [Dasar-dasar Informasi "
"Kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/entanglement-in-"
"action/introduction). Tapi situasinya akan semakin jelas saat kita "
"mengimplementasikannya di Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.2 Quantum circuit simulating the quantum teleportation {#42-quantum-"
"circuit-simulating-the-quantum-teleportation}"
msgstr ""
"4.2 Circuit kuantum yang mensimulasikan teleportasi kuantum {#42-quantum-"
"circuit-simulating-the-quantum-teleportation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As always, we will apply the Qiskit patterns framework. This subsection will"
" focus on mapping only.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti biasa, kita akan menerapkan kerangka pola Qiskit. Bagian ini akan "
"fokus pada pemetaan saja.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators {#step-1-map-problem-"
"to-quantum-circuits-and-operators}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan masalah ke Circuit dan operator kuantum {#step-1-map-"
"problem-to-quantum-circuits-and-operators}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To describe the scenario above, we need a circuit with three qubits: two for"
" the entangled pair shared by Alice and Bob, and one for the unknown quantum"
" state $|\\psi\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggambarkan skenario di atas, kita perlu Circuit dengan tiga qubit: "
"dua untuk pasangan terkait yang dibagikan oleh Alice dan Bob, dan satu untuk"
" state kuantum yang tidak diketahui $|\\psi\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/0e231d46-e185-42c7-a7f6-33b784f4a8f2-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/0e231d46-e185-42c7-a7f6-33b784f4a8f2-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At the start, Alice has an unknown quantum state $|\\psi \\rangle.$ We will "
"create this using the $U$ gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di awal, Alice punya state kuantum yang tidak diketahui $|\\psi \\rangle.$ "
"Kita akan membuatnya menggunakan Gate $U$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/6625f333-131f-4ecb-"
"ae09-c256d6589a61-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/6625f333-131f-4ecb-"
"ae09-c256d6589a61-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can visualize the state we've created, but only because we know what "
"parameters were used in the $U$ gate. If this state had emerged from a "
"complicated quantum process, the state would not be knowable without running"
" the process to create the state many times, and collecting statistics as in"
" tomography.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita bisa memvisualisasikan state yang telah kita buat, tapi hanya karena "
"kita tahu parameter apa yang digunakan di Gate $U$. Kalau state ini muncul "
"dari proses kuantum yang rumit, state tersebut tidak bisa diketahui tanpa "
"menjalankan proses untuk membuat state itu berkali-kali dan mengumpulkan "
"statistik seperti pada tomografi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/7e13315a-cc23-4068-96f8-742edfe9b43f-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/7e13315a-cc23-4068-96f8-742edfe9b43f-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before this protocol even begins, we assume Alice and Bob have a shared "
"entangled pair. If Alice and Bob are truly in different locations, they "
"might have set up the shared state *before* the unknown state "
"$|\\psi\\rangle$ was ever created. Because those things are happening on "
"different qubits, there order here won't matter, and this order is "
"convenient for visualization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum protokol ini dimulai, kita asumsikan Alice dan Bob sudah berbagi "
"pasangan terkait. Kalau Alice dan Bob benar-benar berada di lokasi berbeda, "
"mereka mungkin sudah menyiapkan state yang dibagikan *sebelum* state yang "
"tidak diketahui $|\\psi\\rangle$ pernah dibuat. Karena hal-hal itu terjadi "
"pada qubit yang berbeda, urutannya di sini tidak akan berpengaruh, dan "
"urutan ini nyaman untuk visualisasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/965285c8-de03-4649-8c86-e40730dd7977-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/965285c8-de03-4649-8c86-e40730dd7977-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, Alice entangles $|\\psi \\rangle$ with her part of the shared e-bit, "
"using the $CX$ gate and $H$ gate, and measures them in the computational "
"basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, Alice meng-entangle $|\\psi \\rangle$ dengan bagiannya dari "
"e-bit yang dibagikan, menggunakan Gate $CX$ dan Gate $H$, lalu mengukur "
"keduanya dalam basis komputasional.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/ef9bf28c-24de-47dd-9855-546c69239a09-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/ef9bf28c-24de-47dd-9855-546c69239a09-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alice sends Bob her measurement results (either “00”, “01”, “10”, or “11”), "
"and Bob performs a correction operator based on Alice’s two bits of "
"information on his part of the shared e-bit. Then, Bob's becomes $|\\psi "
"\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alice mengirimkan hasil pengukurannya ke Bob (bisa \"00\", \"01\", \"10\", "
"atau \"11\"), dan Bob melakukan operator koreksi berdasarkan dua bit "
"informasi dari Alice pada bagiannya dari e-bit yang dibagikan. Kemudian, "
"milik Bob menjadi $|\\psi \\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/65c88c15-bf2c-4673-a404-9569f5eefc5d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/65c88c15-bf2c-4673-a404-9569f5eefc5d-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You have completed a quantum teleportation circuit! Let's see the output "
"state of this circuit using the statevector simulator.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu sudah menyelesaikan Circuit teleportasi kuantum! Mari kita lihat state "
"output dari Circuit ini menggunakan simulator statevector.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/31a43d9b-ab5c-4ff7-b804-4298a6cb406f-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/31a43d9b-ab5c-4ff7-b804-4298a6cb406f-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can see that the quantum state created by the $U$-gate of qubit 0 (the "
"qubit originally holding the secret state) has been transferred to qubit 2 "
"(Bob's qubit).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa melihat bahwa state kuantum yang dibuat oleh Gate $U$ pada qubit 0"
" (qubit yang awalnya menyimpan state rahasia) telah dipindahkan ke qubit 2 "
"(qubit Bob).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can run above cell a few times to make sure. You might notice that the "
"qubits 0 and 1 change states, but qubit 2 is always in the state "
"$|\\psi\\rangle $.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menjalankan sel di atas beberapa kali untuk memastikannya. Kamu "
"mungkin memperhatikan bahwa qubit 0 dan 1 berganti state, tapi qubit 2 "
"selalu berada dalam state $|\\psi\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.3 Execute it and confirm the result by applying U inverse {#43-execute-it-"
"and-confirm-the-result-by-applying-u-inverse}"
msgstr ""
"4.3 Jalankan dan konfirmasi hasilnya dengan menerapkan invers U "
"{#43-execute-it-and-confirm-the-result-by-applying-u-inverse}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Above, we checked visually that the teleported state looked correct. Another"
" way to check if the quantum state has been teleported correctly, is to "
"apply the inverse of the $U$ gate on Bob's qubit so that we can measure '0'."
" That is, since $U^{-1}U$ is the identity, if Bob's qubit is in the state "
"created from $U|0\\rangle,$ then applying the inverse should yield "
"$U^{-1}U|0\\rangle=|0\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Di atas, kita sudah memeriksa secara visual bahwa state yang "
"diteleportasikan terlihat benar. Cara lain untuk memeriksa apakah state "
"kuantum telah diteleportasikan dengan benar adalah dengan menerapkan invers "
"Gate $U$ pada qubit Bob sehingga kita bisa mengukur '0'. Yaitu, karena "
"$U^{-1}U$ adalah identitas, jika qubit Bob berada dalam state yang dibuat "
"dari $U|0\\rangle,$ maka menerapkan inversnya seharusnya menghasilkan "
"$U^{-1}U|0\\rangle=|0\\rangle.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/2f2995e4-057b-43ea-982b-626d282ec741-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/2f2995e4-057b-43ea-982b-626d282ec741-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will execute the circuit first using the AerSimulator, before moving on "
"to a real quantum comptuer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menjalankan Circuit terlebih dahulu menggunakan AerSimulator, "
"sebelum beralih ke komputer kuantum nyata.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/8632bc47-259c-43fd-8817-589e87a3c9ad-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/8632bc47-259c-43fd-8817-589e87a3c9ad-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recall that in little endian notation, qubit 2 is the left-most (or bottom-"
"most, in the column labels) qubit. Note that the left- and bottom-most qubit"
" in the column labels is a 0 for all possible outcomes. This shows we have a"
" 100% chance of measuring $q_2$ in the state $|0\\rangle $. This is the "
"expected result, and indicates the teleportation protocol has worked "
"properly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ingat bahwa dalam notasi little endian, qubit 2 adalah qubit paling kiri "
"(atau paling bawah, dalam label kolom). Perhatikan bahwa qubit paling kiri "
"dan paling bawah dalam label kolom adalah 0 untuk semua kemungkinan hasil. "
"Ini menunjukkan kita memiliki probabilitas 100% untuk mengukur $q_2$ dalam "
"state $|0\\rangle$. Ini adalah hasil yang diharapkan, dan menunjukkan "
"protokol teleportasi telah bekerja dengan benar.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.4 Teleportation on a real quantum computer {#44-teleportation-on-a-real-"
"quantum-computer}"
msgstr ""
"4.4 Teleportasi pada komputer kuantum nyata {#44-teleportation-on-a-real-"
"quantum-computer}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we will perform teleportation on a real quantum computer. Using the "
"dynamic circuit function, we can operate mid-circuit using measurement "
"outcomes, implementing in real-time the conditionals operations in the "
"teleportation circuit. For solving problems with real quantum computers, we "
"will follow the four steps of Qiskit patterns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, kita akan melakukan teleportasi pada komputer kuantum nyata. "
"Menggunakan fungsi circuit dinamis, kita bisa beroperasi di tengah Circuit "
"menggunakan hasil pengukuran, mengimplementasikan secara real-time operasi "
"kondisional dalam Circuit teleportasi. Untuk menyelesaikan masalah dengan "
"komputer kuantum nyata, kita akan mengikuti empat langkah pola Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map problem to quantum circuits and operators\n"
msgstr "Petakan masalah ke Circuit dan operator kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize for target hardware\n"
msgstr "Optimalkan untuk perangkat keras target\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Execute on target hardware\n"
msgstr "Jalankan pada perangkat keras target\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Post-process the results\n"
msgstr "Proses pasca hasil\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Exercise 3: Build the teleportation circuit {#exercise-3-build-the-"
"teleportation-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Latihan 3: Bangun Circuit teleportasi {#exercise-3-build-the-teleportation-"
"circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try building the whole teleportation circuit from scratch to test your "
"understanding. Scroll back up if you need a reminder.\n"
msgstr ""
"Coba bangun seluruh Circuit teleportasi dari awal untuk menguji pemahamanmu."
" Scroll ke atas jika kamu butuh pengingat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/d419e3fb-662f-4971-957e-66d2b85aadeb-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/d419e3fb-662f-4971-957e-66d2b85aadeb-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a reminder, applying the inverse of the $U$ gate is just so we can verify"
" the expected behavior. It isn't part of sending the state to Bob, and we "
"would not use that inverse $U$ gate if the only goal was to transfer quantum"
" information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai pengingat, menerapkan invers Gate $U$ hanya untuk memverifikasi "
"perilaku yang diharapkan. Ini bukan bagian dari pengiriman state ke Bob, dan"
" kita tidak akan menggunakan Gate invers $U$ tersebut jika tujuannya hanya "
"memindahkan informasi kuantum.\n"

