#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.5 Key takeaways on quantum teleportation {#45-key-takeaways-on-quantum-"
"teleportation}"
msgstr ""
"4.5 Poin penting tentang teleportasi kuantum {#45-key-takeaways-on-quantum-"
"teleportation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can transport a quantum state to a distant friend by sharing a pair of "
"entangled qubits (an e-bit).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita bisa memindahkan state kuantum ke teman yang jauh dengan berbagi "
"sepasang qubit yang terkait (e-bit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Can quantum teleportation send the quantum state faster than light?\n"
"\tNo, because Alice has to tell Bob the measurement results in a classical way.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Apakah teleportasi kuantum bisa mengirimkan state kuantum lebih cepat dari cahaya?\n"
"\tTidak, karena Alice harus memberitahu Bob hasil pengukurannya secara klasikal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Would quantum teleportation break the \"no cloning theorem\", which forbids copying of a quantum state?\n"
"\tNo, because the original quantum state given to Alice on one of her qubits was lost in measurement. It collapsed to a $|0\\rangle$ or $|1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Apakah teleportasi kuantum melanggar \"teorema no-cloning\", yang melarang penyalinan state kuantum?\n"
"\tTidak, karena state kuantum asli yang diberikan ke Alice pada salah satu qubit-nya hilang dalam pengukuran. State itu runtuh menjadi $|0\\rangle$ atau $|1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5. Superdense coding {#5-superdense-coding}"
msgstr "5. Pengkodean superdense {#5-superdense-coding}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Almost the same setup can be used for a different purpose. Suppose Alice "
"wants to send Bob two bits of classical information, but she has no means of"
" classical communication with Bob. She does, however, share an entangled "
"pair with Bob and she is allowed to send her qubit to Bob's location. Notice"
" the contrast with the quantum teleportation protocol. In teleportation, "
"classical communication _was_ available to the friends, and the goal was to "
"send a quantum state. Here, classical communication is not accessible and "
"they use the transfer of a qubit to share two bits of classical "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hampir pengaturan yang sama bisa digunakan untuk tujuan yang berbeda. "
"Misalkan Alice ingin mengirimkan dua bit informasi klasikal ke Bob, tapi dia"
" tidak punya cara komunikasi klasikal dengan Bob. Namun, dia berbagi "
"pasangan terkait dengan Bob dan dia diizinkan untuk mengirimkan qubit-nya ke"
" lokasi Bob. Perhatikan kontrasnya dengan protokol teleportasi kuantum. "
"Dalam teleportasi, komunikasi klasikal _tersedia_ bagi mereka, dan tujuannya"
" adalah mengirimkan state kuantum. Di sini, komunikasi klasikal tidak "
"tersedia dan mereka menggunakan pemindahan qubit untuk berbagi dua bit "
"informasi klasikal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5.1 The protocol of superdense coding {#51-the-protocol-of-superdense-"
"coding}"
msgstr ""
"5.1 Protokol pengkodean superdense {#51-the-protocol-of-superdense-coding}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Assumption**: Alice has two bits of information, say, $a_1a_2 \\in \\{00, "
"01, 10, 11\\}$. Alice and Bob share an entangled pair (e-bit), but they "
"cannot communicate classically.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Asumsi**: Alice punya dua bit informasi, misalkan $a_1a_2 \\in \\{00, 01, "
"10, 11\\}$. Alice dan Bob berbagi pasangan terkait (e-bit), tapi mereka "
"tidak bisa berkomunikasi secara klasikal.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alice performs one of the following operations on her part of e-bit.\n"
msgstr "Alice melakukan salah satu operasi berikut pada bagiannya dari e-bit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 00$, she does nothing\n"
msgstr "Kalau $a_1a_2 = 00$, dia tidak melakukan apa-apa\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 01$, she applies Z gate\n"
msgstr "Kalau $a_1a_2 = 01$, dia menerapkan Gate Z\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 10$, she applies X gate\n"
msgstr "Kalau $a_1a_2 = 10$, dia menerapkan Gate X\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 11$, she applies Z gate and X gate.\n"
msgstr "Kalau $a_1a_2 = 11$, dia menerapkan Gate Z dan Gate X.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alice sends her part of the e-bit to Bob's location.\n"
msgstr "Alice mengirimkan bagiannya dari e-bit ke lokasi Bob.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Bob applies a CNOT gate with the qubit from Alice as control and his qubit as target, then applies H gate to the qubit from Alice, and measures the two qubits. The possible starting states and results of Bob's operations are:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |00\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |01\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle + |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |10\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle - |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow -|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"3. Bob menerapkan Gate CNOT dengan qubit dari Alice sebagai kontrol dan qubit-nya sebagai target, lalu menerapkan Gate H ke qubit dari Alice, dan mengukur kedua qubit. State awal yang mungkin dan hasil operasi Bob adalah:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |00\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |01\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle + |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |10\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle - |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow -|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that a negative sign of $-|11\\rangle$ is global phase, so it is not "
"measurable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa tanda negatif dari $-|11\\rangle$ adalah fase global, "
"sehingga tidak bisa diukur.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5.2 Quantum circuit simulating the superdense coding {#52-quantum-circuit-"
"simulating-the-superdense-coding}"
msgstr ""
"5.2 Circuit kuantum yang mensimulasikan pengkodean superdense {#52-quantum-"
